  "description": "Locked-row failure in one process. A second DAO Workspace (CreateWorkspace) opens the same copy and holds a pessimistic Edit on row ID 2 of T and of T2 through dynasets. The first Database then runs UPDATE T SET V = V + 1 without options and UPDATE T2 SET V = V + 1 with dbFailOnError. Asks LockEdits, the return, RecordsAffected and Errors of each, then the rows after the held edits are cancelled. Which rows the held lock covers (row or page) is part of the observation.",
